t and librarian interaction feels supportive for realtime practice"]}',NULL,'/generated/assets/students/student_life_bus/content_generated_001/asset_content_generated_001_stage_4_realtime.png','/generated/assets/students/student_life_bus/content_generated_001/asset_content_generated_001_stage_4_realtime.png','passed','approved');
